  "plain": "James Forrestal, the first US Secretary of Defense, kept diaries that were published in two volumes after his death, and they are said never to mention UFOs. The researcher Richard Dolan points this out on an episode about Forrestal. He raises it because the silence matters to the claim that Forrestal knew about UFOs and that this was tied to his death."
